{"id":"n86663-1-8","stage":4,"title":"호우 · 大雨","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86663-1-8-1","ko":"비가 아직도 안 그쳤네?","zh":"雨还没停啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"그쳤네?","meaning":"停止，结束","explanation":"그치다：停止，结束；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그치다","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29775","senseId":"1","lemma":"그치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그쳤네","audio":"/audio/d07f39375d896b861e6b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"d2e1c5743fe04efc","